<section class="mx-auto max-w-xl mt-10">
  <h3 class="text-2xl mt-8">Election coverage</h3>
  <p class="mt-4">
    It was used to analyze and visualize opinions on X about a House of Representatives election, as an effort to make news coverage more transparent.
  </p>
  <h3 class="text-2xl mt-8">Tokyo's long-term strategy, "2050 Tokyo Strategy (draft)"</h3>
  <p class="mt-4">
    It was used to gather citizens' voices for drafting the Tokyo Metropolitan Government's long-term strategy, the "2050 Tokyo Strategy (draft)".
  </p>
  <h3 class="text-2xl mt-8">Broad listening in Utazu Town</h3>
  <p class="mt-4">
    It was used in a pioneering trial to analyze and organize, with AI, a residents' survey (396 free-text answers) for drafting Utazu Town's "Second Comprehensive Plan". Summarizing the opinions, which used to take a lot of time, was done by AI in about ten minutes, making it easier to reflect residents' voices in policy.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4">
    <a
      href="https://www.town.utazu.lg.jp/page/4114.html"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="btn btn-outline h-9"
      hreflang="ja"
    >
      Utazu Town's initiative (Japanese) →
    </a>
  </div>
  <h3 class="text-2xl mt-8">Analyzing Korean political YouTube (Hankook Ilbo)</h3>
  <p class="mt-4">
    For a story by the Hankook Ilbo (한국일보), 3,000 live-chat messages from six Korean political YouTube channels were analyzed with Kouchou AI. Every large topic was shared by channels of both camps. The results were featured in two articles on October 22, 2026.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4">
    <a href="/kouchou-ai/hankookilbo-2026/en/" class="btn btn-outline h-9">See the results →</a>
  </div>
</section>
